s. Each enemy can have its own specialized"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"combat system, allowing for unique behaviors, special abilities, and varied difficulty."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The combat system follows the Gnusto state change pipeline - all state modifications"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"must flow through "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ActionResult"},{"type":"text","text":" objects to ensure proper game state management."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Turn-Based-Flow","text":"Turn-Based Flow","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each combat turn consists of:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Player action (attack, defend, talk, use item, etc.)","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Enemy reaction (counter-attack, taunt, flee, special ability, etc.)"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Resolution of both actions with appropriate state changes","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"anchor":"Enhanced-Combat-Events","text":"Enhanced Combat Events","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The system supports a full range of combat outcomes beyond simple hit\/miss:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Weapon Disarming"}]},{"text":": Combatants can lose their weapons during combat","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Staggering","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Attacks that cause temporary loss of balance and combat effectiveness"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Hesitation"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Combat events th